title: VillageOpening
---
The mountains ahead look no different from the ones I left behind all those years ago.
As a child, I thought all I had to do was follow that road out of the village.
Only later did I learn that beyond every mountain lay another.
It took me years to get where I am now, one step at a time.
People only see that I have a respectable job.
No one knows how many sleepless nights it took,
how many doors closed in my face,
or how many times I had to swallow my frustration and keep going the next day.
I worked so hard to get here, to get this job.
I can’t just lose it now.
Even if it takes
-> Sacrificing others
-> Sacrificing myself
This is a chance, and I will grab ahold of it.
No matter what it takes.
===

title: VillageReturn
---
I should look around today.
Maybe head to the radio room those two people mentioned last night.
===
